  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Use this space to paste or type in any Important Changes During the Quarter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;On January 6, 2026, Targa Resources Corp. completed the acquisition of Stakeholder Midstream LLC, including a FERC-regulated crude oil gathering system formerly known as Stakeholder Midstream Crude Oil Pipeline LLC. The acquisition was effective January 1, 2026. Subsequent to closing, the pipeline entity was renamed San Andres Crude Pipeline LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">2026-06-09</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">Q1</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1.) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2.) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;On January 6, 2026, Targa Resources Corp. completed the acquisition of Stakeholder Midstream LLC, including a FERC-regulated crude oil gathering system formerly known as Stakeholder Midstream Crude Oil Pipeline LLC. The acquisition was effective January 1, 2026. Subsequent to closing, the pipeline entity was renamed San Andres Crude Pipeline LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Targa records allocations of general and administrative (G&amp;amp;A) expenses and recognizes income tax expense as part of the preparation of its quarterly and annual FERC Form 6 financial statements. G&amp;amp;A expenses are allocated from affiliated entities to reflect the cost of shared services provided. Income tax expense is recorded on a stand-alone basis for regulatory reporting purposes and includes both current and deferred components. These entries are recorded as period-end adjustments to ensure the financial statements are presented in accordance with FERC Uniform System of Accounts requirements. An opening deferred tax liability amount that relates to periods prior to 1/1/2026 of approximately $9.4m was recorded in Q1 2026 with a corresponding adjustment to retained earnings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;In addition an asset retirement obligation (ARO) asset and liability related to a crude terminal owned by San Andres Crude Pipeline LLC was recorded effective January 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnualReportToTheStockholdersTextBlock id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3.) N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRespondentAppearingInAnnualReportToTheStockholdersTextBlock>
